{"2732610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nobody Sleeps Tonight", "steam_appid": 2732610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out all our RE:CODE games!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732610/extras/5bba72f9ff3c9c88a0bcb8f5924b4b51.poster.avif?t=1776256504\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732610/extras/5bba72f9ff3c9c88a0bcb8f5924b4b51.webm?t=1776256504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732610/extras/5bba72f9ff3c9c88a0bcb8f5924b4b51.mp4?t=1776256504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your friend disappears in the middle of the night during an isolated forest cabin trip. It's up to you to find them, although it appears the forest may be holding a dark, unexpected secret. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to brave the secrets of the forest and rescue your friend, and get out while you both still can... or while <strong><i>you</i></strong> still can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large randomly generated environments ensuring each playthrough is fresh. A large randomly generated forest and underground tunnel network to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability due to random generations of each new playthrough. Randomized environment, placement of loot, items, points of interest, etc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements - how long will you survive in a strange forest, or will you make it out?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings - Find hidden lore and uncover the true sinister secrets beneath...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the surface of the forest and the secretive caverns below it...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards for things such as fastest escape... can you and your friends set a record?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is at is seems, and your pleasant forest cabin trip will reveal a sinister secret the forest hides.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732610/extras/5bba72f9ff3c9c88a0bcb8f5924b4b51.poster.avif?t=1776256504\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732610/extras/5bba72f9ff3c9c88a0bcb8f5924b4b51.webm?t=1776256504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732610/extras/5bba72f9ff3c9c88a0bcb8f5924b4b51.mp4?t=1776256504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your friend disappears in the middle of the night during an isolated forest cabin trip. It's up to you to find them, although it appears the forest may be holding a dark, unexpected secret. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to brave the secrets of the forest and rescue your friend, and get out while you both still can... or while <strong><i>you</i></strong> still can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large randomly generated environments ensuring each playthrough is fresh. A large randomly generated forest and underground tunnel network to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability due to random generations of each new playthrough. Randomized environment, placement of loot, items, points of interest, etc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements - how long will you survive in a strange forest, or will you make it out?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings - Find hidden lore and uncover the true sinister secrets beneath...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the surface of the forest and the secretive caverns below it...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards for things such as fastest escape... can you and your friends set a record?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is at is seems, and your pleasant forest cabin trip will reveal a sinister secret the forest hides.</p>", "short_description": "a survival horror game about finding your friend who disappears at night in a strange forest hiding a sinister secret.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732610/header.jpg?t=1776256504", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776256504", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732610/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776256504", "website": "https://www.recode.games", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, or 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB Nvidia/AMD GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Best played in the dark with headphones</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Nobody Sleeps Tonight © RE:CODE 2024. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["NobodySlee